4	 * PREVIEW-ONLY sample data for the three new game-landing DIRECTIONS
5	 * (components/marketing/gamelanding/*). Nothing here touches the live
6	 * GameLandingPage or any *-server-hosting route — it exists purely so the
7	 * preview routes render with realistic, game-specific content.
8	 *
9	 * Plans/prices are pulled from the real live pages (rust-server-hosting,
